    "lines": [
      {
        "scene": "hook",
        "text": "Your Lipton tea bag is named after a shopkeeper from Glasgow.",
        "start": 0.3,
        "seconds": 2.38,
        "window": 3.03,
        "fill": 0.785
      },
      {
        "scene": "gardens",
        "text": "That shopkeeper, Thomas Lipton, ended up owning tea gardens on the other side of the world. So how does a grocer get tea gardens?",
        "start": 3.33,
        "seconds": 5.59,
        "window": 6.27,
        "fill": 0.892
      },
      {
        "scene": "start",
        "text": "He opened his first Glasgow shop in 1871, and he wanted no middlemen between him and his customers.",
        "start": 9.6,
        "seconds": 4.87,
        "window": 5.57,
        "fill": 0.874
      },
      {
        "scene": "ceylon",
        "text": "So in 1890 he went to Ceylon, now Sri Lanka, and bought tea estates of his own.",
        "start": 15.17,
        "seconds": 3.71,
        "window": 4.37,
        "fill": 0.849
      },
      {
        "scene": "estate",
        "text": "His packs promised tea straight from his gardens, and his name went up over the factory.",
        "start": 19.53,
        "seconds": 3.32,
        "window": 3.97,
        "fill": 0.836
      },
      {
        "scene": "brokers",
        "text": "But his gardens could never fill every pack. NPR found he bought from brokers too, and only a small part came from his own estates.",
        "start": 23.5,
        "seconds": 5.75,
        "window": 6.4,
        "fill": 0.898
      },
      {
        "scene": "sale",
        "text": "The name stuck anyway. In the end, Unilever sold the tea business that held Lipton, 34 brands in all, for €4.5B.",
        "start": 29.9,
        "seconds": 6.78,
        "window": 7.4,
        "fill": 0.916
      },
      {
        "scene": "loop",
        "text": "His own gardens or the brokers: which one filled your cup? Either way, look closely, because",
        "start": 37.3,
        "seconds": 4.0,
        "window": 4.67,
        "fill": 0.857
      }
    ]
  },
